  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting Critical Stopover Habitat for Buff-breasted Sandpiper Bolivia III PP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will continue to manage 17,300 acres of tropical savanna habitat; continue to manage short-grass habitat away from lake edges for Buff-breasted Sandpiper through patch burns on 4,940 acres of habitat; continue to manage 2,470 acres of lake-edge habitat for Buff-breasted Sandpipers; and ensure law enforcement within the Barba Azul Nature Reserve.</narrative>
  </description>
